BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL (In Packet Tracer, build a reduced model containing two core switches, distribution/access switches for at least two) Tj T* (buildings, representative PCs, a server, VLANs and two ISP routers. Configure trunks or routed uplinks, inter-VLAN) Tj T* (routing, ACLs and default routes. Demonstrate: \(1\) authorised users can ping the server; \(2\) Guest cannot ping Staff or) Tj T* -0.019938 Tw (CCTV; \(3\) a building remains connected after one core link is shut down; and \(4\) internet access switches to the second) Tj T* 0 Tw (ISP when the first ISP link is disabled. Capture screenshots and command outputs.) Tj T* ET
