BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 13.2 TL (With a single collapsed-core switch, failure of that switch can disconnect all buildings, the data centre and both internet) Tj T* (paths unless a second independent device is provided. A redundant pair reduces this risk but also reduces the) Tj T* (equipment saving. Over ten years, the cost of campus-wide downtime, replacement and limited expansion can exceed) Tj T* (the initial saving. Therefore, use a redundant hierarchical core for this campus; consider a collapsed core only for a) Tj T* (small, low-risk site with a properly redundant pair and adequate capacity.) Tj T* ET
